      "id": "claim_5e4cb92e81ae4505af14b9e634ca1d2a",
      "statement": "The monorepo uses npm workspaces (`packages/*`) with five packages: kit (core), kit-ng (Angular adapter), kit-react (React adapter), kit-vue (Vue adapter), and cli (CLI tool).",
